# SoundPlant demo: soul, 72 BPM, Eb major. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# A late-night soul ballad in Eb. The verses circle IV iii ii V and never touch the tonic; the chorus turns the corner
# (IV, Bb/Ab, iii, vi, ii, V) and lands on it at last. A deceptive bVI opens the bridge, a tritone-sub dominant lifts the
# last chorus a semitone, the lifted chorus hangs on IV (a false ending) and the keys come home alone.
# T1 kit  T2 knit finger bass  T3 rayon mellow ep  T4 cane reed lead (the hook, the sigh Bb-Ab-G)  T5 cane nylon
# T6 knit dusty pad  T7 rayon glass bell (the sigh again)  T8 voile soprano (the third voice of the sigh)
# Song: intro 4, verse 8, pre 4, chorus 8, verse 2 8, pre 4, bridge 8, last chorus 8 (+1), tag 4.
bpm 72
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 3
knob 9 e3 0

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the kit: a full kick, a big snare in the hall with a clap on top, brushed hats, a shaker
knob 1 d1.k1 54
knob 1 d1.k2 70
knob 1 d1.k3 84
knob 1 d1.k4 56
knob 1 d1.volume 88
knob 1 d2.k1 66
knob 1 d2.k2 90
knob 1 d2.k3 90
knob 1 d2.k4 96
knob 1 d2.volume 88
knob 1 d2.send2 84
knob 1 d5.k4 60
knob 1 d5.volume 66
knob 1 d5.send2 48
knob 1 d3.volume 44
knob 1 d4.volume 40
knob 1 d9.volume 40
knob 1 d9.send1 14
knob 1 d8.volume 40
knob 1 d8.send2 30
knob 1 d6.volume 50
knob 1 d7.volume 48
knob 1 level 88
# T2 a knit finger bass: round, close to the kick, a little low-pass
preset 2 finger_bass knit
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain 2
knob 2 cut 70
knob 2 level 84
# T3 a rayon mellow electric piano: the chords, in the room
preset 3 mellow_ep rayon
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain 2
knob 3 level 98
knob 3 pan 76
knob 3 send1 20
knob 3 send2 34
# T4 a cane reed lead: the voice of the song, in the echo and the hall
preset 4 reed_lead cane
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 brain 2
knob 4 level 94
knob 4 pan 58
knob 4 send1 34
knob 4 send2 40
# T5 a cane nylon guitar: fingerpicked arpeggios on the left
preset 5 nylon cane
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 brain 2
knob 5 level 84
knob 5 pan 36
knob 5 send1 18
knob 5 send2 34
# T6 a knit dusty pad: the warm bed under everything
preset 6 dusty_pad knit
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain 2
knob 6 level 64
knob 6 pan 66
knob 6 send2 50
# T7 a rayon glass bell: the sigh again, high and small
preset 7 glass_bell rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain 2
knob 7 level 70
knob 7 pan 94
knob 7 send1 36
knob 7 send2 56
# T8 a voile soprano: wordless, the third voice
preset 8 soprano voile
param 8 oct 2
knob 8 brain 2
knob 8 level 72
knob 8 pan 44
knob 8 send1 20
knob 8 send2 60
# FX I a slow echo, FX II a big hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 100
knob 11 e3 46
knob 11 e4 44
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 88
knob 12 e3 58
mst lo 60
mst hi 46
mst comp 44
mst pump 0
mst release 74
mst level 104
groove swing

